{"id":"MOEX-113020-2301-Q029","title":"寄生蟲致病位置：眼、淋巴與膽道","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med2","sourceSha256":"fc58cf710359dfc0509ce2c5093690d8c191ae304af3804871f3361ee8842713","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_ee90c48a1c288191bc647aa0a542d107","sourceAnchor":"q29","shortHtml":"<p>答案是<strong>C，僅①②④</strong>。這題同時考寄生位置與致病方式：犬蛔蟲的<strong>幼蟲移行</strong>可累及眼睛；班氏絲蟲的慢性感染可造成<strong>淋巴回流障礙</strong>；人蛔蟲的成蟲則可能離開原本的腸道位置，進入膽道等部位。</p>","html":"<div><h2>寄生蟲致病位置：眼、淋巴與膽道</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：C</p><h3>①②④成立，③的「必造成死亡」不成立</h3>\n<p>答案是<strong>C，僅①②④</strong>。這題同時考寄生位置與致病方式：犬蛔蟲的<strong>幼蟲移行</strong>可累及眼睛；班氏絲蟲的慢性感染可造成<strong>淋巴回流障礙</strong>；人蛔蟲的成蟲則可能離開原本的腸道位置，進入膽道等部位。</p>\n<h3>①犬蛔蟲：人是幼蟲移行的宿主</h3>\n<p>犬蛔蟲在人類通常不完成犬體內那種腸道成蟲、產卵的生活史。幼蟲可進入組織，造成內臟或<strong>眼部幼蟲移行症</strong>；眼部病灶可有肉芽腫與視力損害。因此①正確，但不能把眼底白色病灶都當成肉眼直接看見整條幼蟲。</p>\n<h3>②班氏絲蟲：從淋巴管損傷理解象皮病</h3>\n<p>班氏絲蟲成蟲主要位於<strong>淋巴系統</strong>。長期淋巴管功能障礙、反覆發炎及組織改變，可使肢體慢性腫大、皮膚增厚，形成象皮病，故②正確。成蟲的淋巴位置與微絲蟲出現在血液中的位置要分開；也不是每位感染者都一定出現象皮病。</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1463px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.8570591681312244\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d76435a4c13b181cad4d0d40cb6fae9c62ba835b1f5d878ea6f39d87b903e892.png\" alt=\"眼弓蛔蟲症視網膜肉芽腫與併發症六面板原圖\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1463\" height=\"1707\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d76435a4c13b181cad4d0d40cb6fae9c62ba835b1f5d878ea6f39d87b903e892.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>眼底A、B可見白黃肉芽腫與視網膜血管的相對位置；其餘面板顯示周邊病灶、牽引等不同表現。這些是發炎病灶，不是每人都有同一組併發症。圖：Ahn等（2014），Figure 1，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:700px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.4522821576763485\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/cd6f4692f2ddba6729b2ff8768050682a7a2b636adfe6ac11e08b731b6619e48.jpg\" alt=\"淋巴絲蟲病下肢象皮病皮膚增厚及腫大\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"482\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/cd6f4692f2ddba6729b2ff8768050682a7a2b636adfe6ac11e08b731b6619e48.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>下肢及踝部增粗、皮膚皺褶加深，連到慢性淋巴回流障礙的結果。單憑外觀仍不能確定病原物種。圖：CDC／J. McDowell（1962），PHIL 373，公版；<a href=\"https://phil.cdc.gov/Details.aspx?pid=373\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">免費原圖</a>。本讀本不代表CDC背書。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n<h3>④人蛔蟲：小腸成蟲也可能走錯位置</h3>\n<p>人蛔蟲（Ascaris lumbricoides）成蟲通常住在<strong>小腸腔</strong>，但可移入膽道等部位，造成膽道阻塞、膽管炎或胰膽相關併發症，這就是本題的<strong>異位寄生</strong>。它與犬蛔蟲幼蟲在人體組織內移行，雖都涉及位置改變，卻是不同物種與不同發育階段。</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:910px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.4444444444444444\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/70cc586123bd994edbf9f298e29e7fd047a451c3fe1bb4e40be6f173d7fe0797.png\" alt=\"膽道與十二指腸相接的解剖放大面板\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"910\" height=\"630\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/70cc586123bd994edbf9f298e29e7fd047a451c3fe1bb4e40be6f173d7fe0797.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>先找Duodenum（十二指腸）與Bile ducts（膽道）的連接，理解腸內成蟲可進入膽道的解剖基礎。原圖未畫蛔蟲。圖：NIDDK／NIH免費公眾素材，取原圖下方完整放大面板；<a href=\"https://www.niddk.nih.gov/news/media-library/18244\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:520px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.3829787234042554\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/3dd0d174821f514801c111a30c24d83a03165a9c44c6e520214a68c4d8271547.jpg\" alt=\"膽道蛔蟲超音波白箭頭所示平行亮線\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"520\" height=\"376\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/3dd0d174821f514801c111a30c24d83a03165a9c44c6e520214a68c4d8271547.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>原白箭頭標出膽管內平行亮線，對應蟲體管壁的回音，稱條帶徵。這是異位寄生的影像實例，並未直接記錄整段移行。圖：Lynser等（2015），Figure 2，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n<h3>③鞭蟲：嚴重感染可以致病，不等於必然死亡</h3>\n<p>鞭蟲成蟲主要位於盲腸、升結腸等大腸部位。許多感染可無明顯症狀；較重感染可造成腹痛、腹瀉、直腸脫垂或生長問題。免疫低下者仍需注意病情，但題目沒有依據把結果寫成<strong>「感染必造成死亡」</strong>，所以③錯誤。</p>\n<p>延伸辨別時，免疫抑制與<strong>糞小桿線蟲</strong>嚴重自體感染／播散的關聯，比鞭蟲更典型；即使如此，也不能把高風險說成百分之百死亡。回到本題的組合，留下①②④即選C。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（二）原題，第29題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/toxocariasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：犬蛔蟲的眼部與內臟幼蟲移行</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/lymphaticfilariasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：成蟲淋巴位置與象皮病</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/trichuriasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：鞭蟲位置與重症表現</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/ascariasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：蛔蟲成蟲與膽道異位移行</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/strongyloidiasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：糞小桿線蟲自體感染的臨床辨別</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.niddk.nih.gov/news/media-library/18244\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases, National Institutes of Health：膽囊、膽道與十二指腸的解剖連接</a></li><li><a href=\"https://journals.plos.org/plosntds/article?id=10.1371/journal.pntd.0002938\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Seong Joon Ahn et al. (2014)：眼弓蛔蟲症的視網膜肉芽腫</a></li><li><a href=\"https://phil.cdc.gov/Details.aspx?pid=373\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC / J. McDowell (1962)：淋巴絲蟲病的下肢象皮病外觀</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4656235/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Donboklang Lynser, Akash Handique, Chhunthang Daniala, Pranjal Phukan, Evarisalin Marbaniang (2015)：膽管內蛔蟲的超音波條帶徵</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":4,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：C"}